@startuml
title 러닝/추천/AI 리포트 Use Case
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "일반 회원" as Member
actor "OpenAI 호환 API" as OpenAIAPI

rectangle "러닝" {
  usecase "UC-006\n러닝 기록 CRUD\n(FR-006)" as UC006
  usecase "UC-007\n러닝 세션 관리\n(FR-007)" as UC007
}

rectangle "추천" {
  usecase "UC-014\n자동 큐레이션\n(FR-014)" as UC014
  usecase "UC-015\n케이던스·심박·운동 강도 기반 추천\n(FR-015)" as UC015
  usecase "UC-016\n추천 결과 저장\n(FR-016)" as UC016
  usecase "UC-024\nAI 러닝 리포트\n(FR-021)" as UC024 <<partial>>
}

Member --> UC006
Member --> UC007
Member --> UC014
Member --> UC016
Member --> UC024

OpenAIAPI --> UC024

UC014 ..> UC015 : <<include>>
UC016 ..> UC014 : <<include>>
UC024 ..> UC006 : <<include>>
UC024 ..> UC014 : <<include>>

note bottom of UC007
  세션 생성/수정/상태 변경/취소,
  참여/참여 취소를 포함한다.
end note

note right of UC024
  저장/생성 로직은 있으나
  실제 provider 호출은 환경 변수와 API Key 필요.
end note
@enduml
